WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Okay,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.933
a number series!

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:10.533
Two,

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:11.133
four,

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:11.700
eight,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.300
sixteen,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.467
and then...

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:15.233
what comes next?

00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:15.800
A.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:16.400
Twenty-four,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.000
B.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.567
Twenty,

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:18.167
C.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:18.733
Thirty-two,

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:19.933
or D.

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:20.500
Thirty?

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.667
Five seconds!

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:28.667
TIME'S UP!

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:31.000
The answer is...

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:31.567
C,

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:32.100
thirty-two!

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.767
Each number doubles:

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:34.333
two,

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:34.900
four,

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.467
eight,

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:36.000
sixteen,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.333
so the next is sixteen times

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.000
two is thirty-two.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.767
Check this out,

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.400
a word analogy!

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.567
Fish is to swim,

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:49.700
as bird is to...

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.233
what?

00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:50.767
A.

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:51.333
Walk,

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:51.867
B.

00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:52.400
Sing,

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:52.933
C.

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:53.467
Hop,

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:54.567
or D.

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:55.100
Fly?

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.167
Five seconds!

00:01:01.967 --> 00:01:03.167
TIME'S UP!

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:04.300
It's...

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:04.733
D,

00:01:04.733 --> 00:01:05.200
fly!

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.467
A fish moves by swimming,

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:10.167
so a bird moves by flying.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:13.367
It is how each animal gets around.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.000
Check this out,

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.000
fill in the blank!

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
The library was so quiet that

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.467
even a whisper seemed blank,

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:26.467
so everyone tried hard not to

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:27.967
make a sound.

00:01:27.967 --> 00:01:28.467
A.

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:28.967
Heavy,

00:01:28.967 --> 00:01:29.467
B.

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:29.967
Loud,

00:01:29.967 --> 00:01:30.467
C.

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:30.967
Colorful,

00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:31.967
or D.

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:32.467
Expensive?

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:33.467
Five seconds!

00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:40.433
TIME'S UP!

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:41.533
It's...

00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:41.967
B,

00:01:41.967 --> 00:01:42.367
loud!

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.500
In a place that quiet,

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.067
even a tiny whisper stands out

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:48.333
and seems loud.

00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:50.467
Only loud fits the meaning.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.000
So,

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.033
are you smart or fart?

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:56.467
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:57.667
find your rank!

00:01:58.833 --> 00:01:59.167
So,

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:00.567
how did you do?

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:01.933
Comment your score below,

00:02:01.933 --> 00:02:03.300
and follow for more!
